{"id":"d1e530bf0272a409","group":"14","path":"14/14-ex-bounded-functions-not-sheaf.md","title":"Example II.1 Bounded Continuous Functions Need Not Form a Sheaf","display":"Example II.1 Bounded Continuous Functions Need Not Form a Sheaf","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-ex-bounded-functions-not-sheaf","aliases":["14-ex-bounded-functions-not-sheaf"],"display":"Example II.1 Bounded Continuous Functions Need Not Form a Sheaf","depends_on":["[[14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf]]","[[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]","[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]"],"source_location":"II.1, printed 66–67; DjVu 39","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-ex-bounded-functions-not-sheaf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-ex-bounded-functions-not-sheaf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Example II.1 Bounded Continuous Functions Need Not Form a Sheaf"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"14008e4af86a6831\" href=\"?note=14008e4af86a6831\" title=\"14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf\">14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9607e7b53e4ed265\" href=\"?note=9607e7b53e4ed265\" title=\"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves\">14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.1, printed 66–67; DjVu 39"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\mathbb R\">\\(X=\\mathbb R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为其通常拓扑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(C_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14008e4af86a6831\" href=\"?note=14008e4af86a6831\" title=\"14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf\">14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf</a>。取值和限制的参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\\in\\tau\">\\(U,V\\in\\tau\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq U\">\\(V\\subseteq U\\)</span>；底层限制函数按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 包装为集合箭头。实数、绝对值和自然数采用标准 ZFC 构造。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sep}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sep}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9607e7b53e4ed265\" href=\"?note=9607e7b53e4ed265\" title=\"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves\">14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves</a> 中的精确签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B(U)=\\{u\\in C_{\\mathbb R}(U):\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;|u(x)|\\le M\\},\\qquad\\rho^U_{B,V}(u)=u|_V.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B(U)=\\{u\\in C_{\\mathbb R}(U):\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;|u(x)|\\le M\\},\\qquad\\rho^U_{B,V}(u)=u|_V.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_n=(-n,n)\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}),\\qquad s_n:U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\quad s_n(x)=x.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_n=(-n,n)\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}),\\qquad s_n:U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\quad s_n(x)=x.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}U_n=\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(s_n\\in B(U_n)\\land s_n|_{U_n\\cap U_m}=s_m|_{U_n\\cap U_m}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}U_n=\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(s_n\\in B(U_n)\\land s_n|_{U_n\\cap U_m}=s_m|_{U_n\\cap U_m}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists s\\in B(\\mathbb R)\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(s|_{U_n}=s_n),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sep}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists s\\in B(\\mathbb R)\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(s|_{U_n}=s_n),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sep}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>限制保持有界，函数的局部相等推出全局相等，所以它是分离预层。相容族的唯一函数拼接是恒等函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto x\">\\(x\\mapsto x\\)</span>，它在整个实线上无界，故不能在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(\\mathbb R)\">\\(B(\\mathbb R)\\)</span> 中拼接。反例指出“存在某个统一界”不具有覆盖局部性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"14008e4af86a6831","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves","status":"resolved","id":"9607e7b53e4ed265","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"14008e4af86a6831","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取 $X=\\mathbb R$，$\\tau$ 为其通常拓扑，$C_{\\mathbb R}$ 见 [[14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf]]。取值和限制的参数为 $U,V\\in\\tau$ 且 $V\\subseteq U$；底层限制函数按 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 包装为集合箭头。实数、绝对值和自然数采用标准 ZFC 构造。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取 $X=\\mathbb R$，$\\tau$ 为其通常拓扑，$C_{\\mathbb R}$ 见 [[14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf]]。取值和限制的参数为 $U,V\\in\\tau$ 且 $V\\subseteq U$；底层限制函数按 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 包装为集合箭头。实数、绝对值和自然数采用标准 ZFC 构造。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSheaf}$ 沿用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Sep}$ 沿用 [[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]] 中的精确签名。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves","status":"resolved","id":"9607e7b53e4ed265","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSheaf}$ 沿用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Sep}$ 沿用 [[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]] 中的精确签名。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"C_{\\mathbb R}","display":false},{"tex":"U,V\\in\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"V\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sep}","display":false},{"tex":"B(U)=\\{u\\in C_{\\mathbb R}(U):\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;|u(x)|\\le M\\},\\qquad\\rho^U_{B,V}(u)=u|_V.","display":true},{"tex":"U_n=(-n,n)\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}),\\qquad s_n:U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\quad s_n(x)=x.","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}U_n=\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;(s_n\\in B(U_n)\\land s_n|_{U_n\\cap U_m}=s_m|_{U_n\\cap U_m}),","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists s\\in B(\\mathbb R)\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;(s|_{U_n}=s_n),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sep}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"x\\mapsto x","display":false},{"tex":"B(\\mathbb R)","display":false}],"bytes":2126,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-bounded-functions-not-sheaf|Example II.1 Bounded Continuous Functions Need Not Form a Sheaf]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-bounded-functions-not-sheaf]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-bounded-functions-not-sheaf]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-bounded-functions-not-sheaf]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-bounded-functions-not-sheaf|Example II.1 Bounded Continuous Functions Need Not Form a Sheaf]]"}],"outgoing":["14008e4af86a6831","9607e7b53e4ed265","f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0"]}